3. Scientific and Technical Disclaimer

Gene-In is a bioinformatics support tool for the recovery, screening, operational classification, organization, and interpretation support of candidate viral fragments from sequencing data.

Gene-In does not provide biological confirmation, clinical diagnosis, definitive pathogen detection, or regulatory-grade validation.

Similarity-based bioinformatic results must be interpreted conservatively and must be evaluated together with sample context, laboratory methods, sequencing quality, reference database limitations, and independent confirmatory analyses when applicable.

